RegistrationService --> RegistrationRepository
RegistrationService --> ScheduleRepository

SchedulingService --> ScheduleRepository
SchedulingService --> SectionRepository
SchedulingService --> RoomRepository
SchedulingService --> TimeSlotRepository
SchedulingService --> TeacherQualificationRepository
SchedulingService --> TeacherPreferenceRepository
